  <item>
    <title>No.3不焦虑何以谈人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646a3d7953a5e5ea14ac326f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646a3d7953a5e5ea14ac326f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 May 2023 15:49:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong><span>小懒、阿白</span></p><span></span><p><span>焦虑的反义词是什么，有人说是淡定，也有人说是松弛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们认为，</span><strong><span>焦虑的反义词是具体。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>把焦虑细分到生活日常中，大卸八块后可能就不那么沉重了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当下年轻人经历着奇奇怪怪的焦虑：电量焦虑、健康焦虑、社交焦虑（社恐）、打电话焦虑、远行焦虑、消费焦虑、人生意义焦虑……</span></p><span></span><p><span>似乎不焦虑都不足以谈人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些焦虑如何内耗我、成就我？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何与焦虑相处呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>对</span><strong><span>容貌</span></strong><span>焦虑、</span><strong><span>财富</span></strong><span>焦虑、</span><strong><span>学习</span></strong><span>焦虑三大板块展开，谈谈压不死我们的那些焦虑们~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【推荐书目】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《穷爸爸富爸爸》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Trent Dabbs - Set for Life</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【互动方式】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>播客收听平台：小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>v x公众号：偷懒公社</span></p><span></span><p><span>小hs：偷懒公社读书会</span></p><span></span><p><span>活动报名v x号：lazycommune</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系邮箱：lazycommune@126.com（观点投稿及合作洽谈）</span></p>]]></description>
