    <guid isPermaLink="false">645a3136306513184c7e9a08</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 May 2023 11:40:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】阿白、小懒</span></p><span></span><p><span>转眼我们偷懒公社的线下活动已经进行到了第14期啦，是时候来和我们线上的小伙伴们交流一下了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们要来和大家聊一个话题，关于人生的可能性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>正如标题所说：</span><strong><span>人生是旷野，而不是轨道。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你不一定非要长成玫瑰，你乐意的话，做茉莉，做雏菊，做无名小花，做千千万万。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家和我们交流你的旷野人生！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【推荐书目】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>加缪的</span><strong><span>《局外人》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阿德勒的</span><strong><span>《被讨厌的勇气》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【推荐电影】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>皮克斯的</span><strong><span>《头脑特工队》《心灵奇旅》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>宫崎骏的</span><strong><span>《侧耳倾听》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>杏 - 翼をください</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【互动方式】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>播客收听平台：小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>同名v x公众号：偷懒公社</span></p><span></span><p><span>同名小hs：偷懒公社</span></p><span></span><p><span>活动报名v x号：lazycommune</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系邮箱：lazycommune@126.com（观点投稿及合作洽谈）</span></p>]]></description>
